{"1769960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horizon Journey", "steam_appid": 1769960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/c5b21769ca7ca109e40946beb00c9da3.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/c5b21769ca7ca109e40946beb00c9da3.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/c5b21769ca7ca109e40946beb00c9da3.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure to Mars in Horizon Journey, an open-world survival game that blends colonization, terraforming, and exploration in both single-player and multiplayer co-op modes. Set in the year 2053, you are part of the 17th Endeavor mission, tasked with the monumental challenge of making Mars a new home for humanity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Martian Landscape:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Mars like never before with an environment based on real NASA imagery. Explore the stunning, harsh, and mysterious landscapes of the Red Planet with accurate environmental settings and lighting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/35b2c9ea19271f4afd4dd17a4103eceb.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/35b2c9ea19271f4afd4dd17a4103eceb.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/35b2c9ea19271f4afd4dd17a4103eceb.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival and Colonization:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance survival and colonization efforts as you gather resources, build structures, and terraform the Martian surface. Customize your base with a modular building system, ensuring each compartment is uniquely tailored to your needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single and Multiplayer Co-op:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends in co-op multiplayer mode. Work together to explore distant regions, gather resources, and defend against the lurking dangers of Mars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/2aabebc175997b105dd70f61556c3f40.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/2aabebc175997b105dd70f61556c3f40.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/2aabebc175997b105dd70f61556c3f40.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Resource Gathering:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the remnants of past missions, scavenging old colony zones for valuable minerals and hidden treasures. Use advanced rovers equipped with thermal vision, night vision, and mining dredging scanners to uncover remote areas and underground resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the hidden dangers beneath the Martian surface. Old colony zones may hide more than the eye can see. Be ready for every situation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/7a064de35024e74b70eeb46ce9715bcf.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/7a064de35024e74b70eeb46ce9715bcf.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/7a064de35024e74b70eeb46ce9715bcf.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Technology and Vehicles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your vehicles designed for remote exploration, equipped with expanded compartments and survival reservoirs. Discover unknown technological components to enhance your tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Crafting System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the intricate crafting system with excavations from mineral deposits, use branching components in various developments and combine sub-components to produce final products.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d6ade4587e7938568f816f2492f284bb.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d6ade4587e7938568f816f2492f284bb.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d6ade4587e7938568f816f2492f284bb.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Atmospheric Conditions:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the extreme conditions of Mars, including sandstorms, radiation zones, and temperature fluctuations. Manage your health, oxygen, hunger, and thirst while facing environmental challenges that can damage your equipment and threaten your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect financial assets and valuable minerals, adjust resource ratios, and use specialized tools to manage your colony’s needs. Utilize unique production modifications, including an artificial food synthesizer, material conversion synthesizer, aquarium unit, and analysis table, all connected to the colony's electrical system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d238d6ed17e2a89e9258a38f0f02122a.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d238d6ed17e2a89e9258a38f0f02122a.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d238d6ed17e2a89e9258a38f0f02122a.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Horizon Journey, every decision counts. As you explore the vast Martian landscape, uncover the secrets of past missions, build a thriving colony, and you will shape the future of humanity on Mars. Are you ready to take on the ultimate survival challenge and make your mark on the Red Planet?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/c5b21769ca7ca109e40946beb00c9da3.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/c5b21769ca7ca109e40946beb00c9da3.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/c5b21769ca7ca109e40946beb00c9da3.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure to Mars in Horizon Journey, an open-world survival game that blends colonization, terraforming, and exploration in both single-player and multiplayer co-op modes. Set in the year 2053, you are part of the 17th Endeavor mission, tasked with the monumental challenge of making Mars a new home for humanity. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Martian Landscape:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Mars like never before with an environment based on real NASA imagery. Explore the stunning, harsh, and mysterious landscapes of the Red Planet with accurate environmental settings and lighting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/35b2c9ea19271f4afd4dd17a4103eceb.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/35b2c9ea19271f4afd4dd17a4103eceb.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/35b2c9ea19271f4afd4dd17a4103eceb.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival and Colonization:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance survival and colonization efforts as you gather resources, build structures, and terraform the Martian surface. Customize your base with a modular building system, ensuring each compartment is uniquely tailored to your needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single and Multiplayer Co-op:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with friends in co-op multiplayer mode. Work together to explore distant regions, gather resources, and defend against the lurking dangers of Mars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/2aabebc175997b105dd70f61556c3f40.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/2aabebc175997b105dd70f61556c3f40.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/2aabebc175997b105dd70f61556c3f40.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Resource Gathering:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the remnants of past missions, scavenging old colony zones for valuable minerals and hidden treasures. Use advanced rovers equipped with thermal vision, night vision, and mining dredging scanners to uncover remote areas and underground resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware the hidden dangers beneath the Martian surface. Old colony zones may hide more than the eye can see. Be ready for every situation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/7a064de35024e74b70eeb46ce9715bcf.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/7a064de35024e74b70eeb46ce9715bcf.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/7a064de35024e74b70eeb46ce9715bcf.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Technology and Vehicles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your vehicles designed for remote exploration, equipped with expanded compartments and survival reservoirs. Discover unknown technological components to enhance your tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive Crafting System:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the intricate crafting system with excavations from mineral deposits, use branching components in various developments and combine sub-components to produce final products.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d6ade4587e7938568f816f2492f284bb.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d6ade4587e7938568f816f2492f284bb.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d6ade4587e7938568f816f2492f284bb.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Atmospheric Conditions:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the extreme conditions of Mars, including sandstorms, radiation zones, and temperature fluctuations. Manage your health, oxygen, hunger, and thirst while facing environmental challenges that can damage your equipment and threaten your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect financial assets and valuable minerals, adjust resource ratios, and use specialized tools to manage your colony’s needs. Utilize unique production modifications, including an artificial food synthesizer, material conversion synthesizer, aquarium unit, and analysis table, all connected to the colony's electrical system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d238d6ed17e2a89e9258a38f0f02122a.poster.avif?t=1769760058\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d238d6ed17e2a89e9258a38f0f02122a.webm?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/extras/d238d6ed17e2a89e9258a38f0f02122a.mp4?t=1769760058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Horizon Journey, every decision counts. As you explore the vast Martian landscape, uncover the secrets of past missions, build a thriving colony, and you will shape the future of humanity on Mars. Are you ready to take on the ultimate survival challenge and make your mark on the Red Planet?</p>", "short_description": "Embark on an epic adventure to Mars in Horizon Journey, an open-world survival game that blends colonization, terraforming, and exploration in both single-player and multiplayer co-op modes. You're tasked with the monumental challenge of making Mars a new home for humanity.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/header.jpg?t=1769760058", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1769960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769760058", "capsule_imagev5":